    "message": "Show and control each branch's computation on the project screen\n\nThe screen read the Run's status, which is running while any branch\ncomputes, so every branch's buttons were disabled and a fork waited for\nother branches to stop. It now reads the selected branch's status: its\ncompute, fork and preview buttons are disabled only while it computes,\nthe branch list marks computing branches, a fork ends when its child is\nlisted and still or its outcome failed, and cancel stops the selected\nbranch. A Run without branch statuses still uses its own.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
